{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Maria! Guess what? I'm now part of the fire-fighting brigade. I'm super excited to be involved and help out my community!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_32-0c6c54c37589a85d2e5ad7c1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:31.364372+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0c6c54c37589a85d2e5ad7c1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0c6c54c37589a85d2e5ad7c1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow John, that's impressive! You're really enthusiastic about making a change. How's your experience been so far?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_32-4a160c897dacf798d7e023c8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:31.388317+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4a160c897dacf798d7e023c8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4a160c897dacf798d7e023c8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I was impressed with their dedication and how well they worked together. Just being around them was so inspiring!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_32-3c092fe8fdc955f6a8e52c83", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:31.412122+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3c092fe8fdc955f6a8e52c83", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3c092fe8fdc955f6a8e52c83", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: That's amazing. Must have been awesome to see all those people working together."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_32-d4c9373bea724a5fea8cd5d9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:31.434496+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d4c9373bea724a5fea8cd5d9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d4c9373bea724a5fea8cd5d9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: It definitely was! Everyone was so into it. It's amazing how a group can succeed at something so important. It only took us two hours. We worked hard but did something good \u2013 it was really satisfying."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_32-05cb64d5efea4c934610a991", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:31.464057+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "05cb64d5efea4c934610a991", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "05cb64d5efea4c934610a991", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John! It looks like everyone was working hard. Did you raise any donations?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_32-26f210c3f826c9c9dfc0a10f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:31.488788+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "26f210c3f826c9c9dfc0a10f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "26f210c3f826c9c9dfc0a10f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yup, we raised a ton! We got stuff like canned food, toiletries, and clothes to help out. Feels great to be part of it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_32-bcd4947e7134bb845ad289f0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:31.508182+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bcd4947e7134bb845ad289f0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bcd4947e7134bb845ad289f0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: I bet! It's great to see the community coming together to support the local fire station."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_32-391621351c826c4f345c7d9a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:31.525686+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "391621351c826c4f345c7d9a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "391621351c826c4f345c7d9a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: You're right, Maria. It's great to help out and see everyone coming together for this cause. It gives me a sense of purpose and passion. I feel like this is my true calling."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_32-9753b1da0f73c4e7cb0f70f2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:31.540708+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9753b1da0f73c4e7cb0f70f2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9753b1da0f73c4e7cb0f70f2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Awesome, John! Loving your newfound passion. You're doing great things - keep it up! It's wonderful to see everyone coming together for this cause."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_32-5874b72aeae529b008f531e1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:31.560264+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5874b72aeae529b008f531e1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5874b72aeae529b008f531e1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! Your support means a lot to me. It's amazing how finding my passion has made such a big impact. I'll keep working hard on it. The donations even helped get a brand new fire truck!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_32-b07bbf7498117aecf21597b8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:31.576275+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b07bbf7498117aecf21597b8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b07bbf7498117aecf21597b8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Look at that - we all donated for it, and it looks awesome!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_32-4d0d5374a69d8fb3beb7dfc9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:31.593510+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4d0d5374a69d8fb3beb7dfc9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4d0d5374a69d8fb3beb7dfc9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks for being a part of this with me, Maria. I appreciate your support."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_32-5a70553efedb899a26aa5f30", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:31.611629+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5a70553efedb899a26aa5f30", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5a70553efedb899a26aa5f30", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Hey John, I'm here for you. Last Friday, I spent some time at the shelter volunteering at the front desk. Seeing the smiles on their faces when they got food or a bed really made me feel good. We have the power to make a difference in people's lives."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_32-b5dc7bd2b1db8f72467d3a5e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:31.632117+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b5dc7bd2b1db8f72467d3a5e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b5dc7bd2b1db8f72467d3a5e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Maria, I'm glad you're finding fulfillment there. It's amazing how a little kindness can have such a big impact on someone's life. Let's continue making a difference in our community!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_32-3f771d31b6ec3f01091e1e72", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:31.658349+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3f771d31b6ec3f01091e1e72", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3f771d31b6ec3f01091e1e72", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yeah, John! Let's keep spreading kindness. It's awesome to know we can bring joy and comfort to those who need it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_32-9760775d990d155028aad993", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:31.677609+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9760775d990d155028aad993", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9760775d990d155028aad993", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, Maria, let's keep each other and everyone else motivated to make a difference! Together, our impact will surely last."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-41/session_32-10a0727d0669d964c836ffc8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:19:31.696409+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "10a0727d0669d964c836ffc8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "10a0727d0669d964c836ffc8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
